  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个 Serilum 模组。用心制作。为 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供了大量活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于此模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">愚人节模组为游戏增添了各种愚蠢且有趣的特性和游戏机制。默认情况下，它们仅在<strong>4月1日</strong>自动启用。但你可以随意通过配置文件在每一天都启用它们。这里有一个全局开关，你也可以单独启用或禁用各个功能。希望这个模组能为游玩你的模组包和/或服务器的任何人脸上增添笑容！<br><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>功能特性</strong></span>：<br>&nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; 玩家睡觉时脚会枕在枕头上。<br>&nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; 流浪商人将生成在驴子旁边而不是羊驼旁边。<br>&nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; 让猫叫得像狗，狼叫得像猫。<br>&nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; 奶牛在被挤奶时有几率掉落水桶或岩浆桶。<br>&nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; 苦力怕可能不会爆炸，而是发射带有苦力怕图案的烟花火箭。<br>&nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; 使所有从马铃薯植株掉落的马铃薯变成有毒的。<br>&nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; 骷髅可以生成时手持剑和盾，而不是弓。<br>&nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; 玩家从弓射出的普通箭有几率附带随机药水效果。捡起后恢复为普通箭。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含在 Vanilla Experience 中\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/extra-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含在 Serilum 的额外捆绑包中\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/both.svg\" alt=\"环境：客户端与服务端\" width=\"293\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置选项：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableOnlyOnApril1st</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">愚人节功能是否仅在4月1日启用。如果设置为 false，则将始终启用。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>april1stChanceMultiplier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 0.0，最小值 0.0，最大值 1000.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">可用于增加愚人节当天功能触发的几率。例如，你可以将 'enableOnlyOnApril1st' 设置为 false，将 'chanceCreepersExplodeIntoFireworks' 设置为 0.01，并将 'april1stChanceMultiplier' 设置为 25.0。这样，苦力怕在非4月1日有 1/100 的几率发射烟花火箭，而在愚人节当天则有 1/4 的几率。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>makeCatsBarkAndDogsMeow</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否让猫像狗一样叫，让狗像猫一样叫。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>makePlayersSleepWithFeetOnPillow</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否让玩家以相反的方式睡觉，即脚枕在枕头上。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>makeWanderingTraderSpawnWithDonkeys</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否让流浪商人生成时带着两只驴而不是羊驼。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>chanceCowGivesDifferentBucket</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 0.2，最小值 0.0，最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">奶牛被挤奶时，掉落岩浆桶或水桶而非牛奶桶的几率。设置为 0 以禁用。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>chanceCreepersExplodeIntoFireworks</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 0.5，最小值 0.0，最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">苦力怕是否会不爆炸，而是生成一个带有苦力怕图案的烟花火箭。默认为 50% 几率。设置为 0 以禁用。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>chancePotatoCropDropsPoisonous</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 1.0，最小值 0.0，最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">马铃薯植株掉落的马铃薯在收获时被制成有毒马铃薯的几率。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>chanceSkeletonHasSwordAndShield</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 0.25，最小值 0.0，最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">骷髅生成时手持剑和盾而不是弓的几率。设置为 0 以禁用。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>chanceNormalArrowFiredHasRandomEffect</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 0.33，最小值 0.0，最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">玩家射出的箭附带随机药水效果的几率。设置为 0 以禁用。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>视频展示：</strong></span><br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2VfpIna69U0\" height=\"475\" width=\"100%\"></iframe></span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">流浪商人把它的羊驼留在了家里，反而带来了两只驴！</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/april-fools/a.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">苦力怕有 50% 的几率不爆炸，而是发射烟花火箭！</span><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/april-fools/b.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">玩家和村民睡觉时脚枕在枕头上！</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/april-fools/c.png\" alt=\"\"><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/april-fools/d.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">第一人称视角下同样有效：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/april-fools/e.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">骷髅有 25% 的几率生成时手持剑和盾！</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/april-fools/f.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下载源保持在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统内，你就可以在任何模组包中自由使用此模组。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含了所有可用模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由于我无法在如此多独立的模组页面中跟踪评论，因此评论区已禁用。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>对于问题、想法、建议或其他任何内容，请访问 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
